5500/extras/cedc3a97ace3844ee1fbb655b48447e4.poster.avif?t=1754386712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/925500/extras/cedc3a97ace3844ee1fbb655b48447e4.webm?t=1754386712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/925500/extras/cedc3a97ace3844ee1fbb655b48447e4.mp4?t=1754386712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/925500/extras/5ccd5219612ede5c79b636c8cee903df.avif?t=1754386712\" /></div><br>A new type of gold rush has begun. Tomb robbers, outlaws, mercenaries, merchants, messengers, priests, cultists, soldiers, spies... all flock to The Weary Pilgrim for hospitality. Few are who they say they are \u2014 but some may be friends. Build a tight-knit group of outcasts and work together to reveal an ancient secret, before the flames of war engulf your new-found home.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/925500/extras/69994bf568b5f0e7277934af6eedefab.poster.avif?t=1754386712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/925500/extras/69994bf568b5f0e7277934af6eedefab.webm?t=1754386712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/925500/extras/69994bf568b5f0e7277934af6eedefab.mp4?t=1754386712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
